        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVVER, Fifth Avenue Versailles Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fifth Avenue Plate With Versailles Knob is truly elegant. The free-flowing movement of light through the crystal knob heightens the grace of the piece. Glorified from over a century of history, the Fifth Avenue style is found in many of America's finest homes, offices and public buildings. The Fifth Avenue Plate's simple lines combined with the Crystal Versailles Knob's classic style, draw attention to the stoutness created by its designers. This clean, classic design is a favorite in decorative door hardware. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-fifth-avenue-series\"><b>Fifth Avenue Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur FAVVER Fifth Avenue Plate With Versailles Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Fifth Avenue Rose is made out of solid forged brass and the Fontainebleau Knob is 24% lead crystal.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fifth Avenue Versailles Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Height: 7.17\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Width: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Versailles Knob Diameter: 2.30\"</li>\r\n<li>Versailles Knob Projection: 2.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVVER-specifications.pdf?v=1704262181\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVVER Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Fifth Avenue Plate with Versailles Crystal Knob",
                "description": "Grandeur FAVVER, Fifth Avenue Versailles Knob - The Fifth Avenue Plate With Versailles Knob is truly elegant. The free-flowing movement of light through the crystal knob heightens the grace of the piece. Glorified by over a century of history, the Fifth Avenue style is found in many of America's finest homes, offices and public buildings. The Fifth Avenue Plate's simple lines combined with the Crystal Versailles Knob's classic style, draw attention to the stoutness created by its designers. This clean, classic design is a favorite in decorative door hardware. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
